      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Drug coated stents have reduced the incidence of in-stent restenosis with coronary intervention. Whether this effect is long lasting or just delaying the process is not clear. We report here a case of late in-stent restenosis with Rapamycin drug eluting stent."},
